      "44. One-page brand and business summary\n| Area | Your notes |\n| --- | --- |\n| Interests | What subjects genuinely interest you? |\n| Skills | What can you do or teach credibly? |\n| Through-line | What connects your interests? |\n| Audience | Who benefits from your perspective? |\n| Problem | What do they need help with? |\n| Positioning | What do you help them achieve? |\n| Mission | Why does this work matter to you? |\n| Vision | What positive change do you want to support? |\n| Anti-vision | What outcome or pattern do you want to move away from? |\n| Content pillars | What themes will you publish about? |\n| Offer | What can people buy? |\n| Distribution | Where will you reach them? |\n| Next experiment | What is the most important thing to test? |",
      "45. Weekly content planner\n| Content slot | Topic | Audience benefit | Format | Status |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Short post 1 |  |  |  |  |\n| Short post 2 |  |  |  |  |\n| Short post 3 |  |  |  |  |\n| Short post 4 |  |  |  |  |\n| Long-form piece |  |  |  |  |",
